# No Cursor git attribution

Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, or any Cursor/agent attribution trailer to commits, PR descriptions, or code comments.

When creating commits, use only the subject/body requested by the user. Do not pass `--trailer` to git commit.
